    "op": "validate_min_timestamp",
    "doc": "validate_min_timestamp(raw) returns true iff decoded_timestamp_ms >= MIN_TIMESTAMP_MS (1700000000000, \u2248 2023-11-14). The standard decoder accepts all timestamps in [0, MAX_TIMESTAMP_MS]; this helper is non-normative defense-in-depth for callers who want to reject obviously-malformed (e.g. zero-filled) buffers."
